{"title":"King Flock® Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eBring a Winter Wonderland Home with the King Flock Artificial Christmas Tree\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eTransform your holiday space with the soft, snow dusted beauty of the King Flock artificial Christmas tree collection from King of Christmas. Designed to capture the magical look of a tree freshly touched by a winter snowfall, the King Flock features a stunning white flock finish layered over lush mixed PE and PVC foliage for a look that is both elegant and full of character. Whether you are drawn to the peaceful, wintry aesthetic or looking to create a sophisticated holiday display, the King Flock delivers a breathtaking centerpiece that makes an impression from every angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, the King Flock collection is designed to fit a variety of home layouts, from spacious living rooms with room for a grand, wide tree to narrower spaces where a slimmer profile is the smarter choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWhy choose the King Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe King Flock is the perfect choice for anyone who wants to create a refined, wintery holiday atmosphere. Its mixed PE and PVC branch construction delivers both texture and fullness, while the white flock finish adds a layer of visual depth and contrast that makes ornaments, warm lighting, and metallic accents truly pop. It is a statement tree, one that sets the tone for your entire holiday décor the moment it goes up.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eShould I choose the full or slim King Flock Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe full King Flock offers a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with generous branch spread and a commanding presence. Its fuller profile gives you maximum decorating real estate for \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, and decorative tree garland, making it ideal for larger living rooms, great rooms, or open spaces where you want the tree to serve as a bold focal point.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe slim King Flock delivers the same stunning flock finish and mixed foliage construction in a narrower, more upright profile. It is an excellent option for apartments, smaller living rooms, entryways, or any space where a full-width tree would feel too large.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eIs the King Flock available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Flock collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to suit your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit King Flock artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that casts a warm, beautiful glow through the white flock and layered branches. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless, no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the King Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe King Flock is beautifully versatile when it comes to decorating. The flocking pairs beautifully with cool, icy tones such as silver, blue, and white for a classic winter wonderland look. It also works strikingly well with warm gold and champagne accents, blush and rose tones for a modern holiday aesthetic, or rich jewel tones like burgundy and emerald for a dramatic, luxurious feel. Whether you prefer a minimal, monochromatic styling or a maximalist layered display, the King Flock provides a stunning canvas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eIs the King Flock easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The King Flock is designed for straightforward setup, easy storage, and lasting durability season after season. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, creating a full and beautifully shaped tree with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and position the branches comfortably during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected and the flock intact between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the season is over, the King Flock disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place to preserve the flock finish, foliage, and overall condition for many years of use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the King Flock collection and find the perfect size and silhouette to make your holiday season unforgettable.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642901393472,"sku":"KFS-T6.5-U","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_e7d10a3a-8506-4193-a238-f2c4735477fb.jpg?v=1718158125"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901524544,"sku":"KFS-T6.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.sho